exander Rowe and Mei Chen as the most recent contributors and suggests Mei Chen as a second reviewer. It does not give the repo-wide departed share. It does not list Kofi Mensah. It treats Alex Rowe as possibly two people. It also lists Sam Okafor in the active table. It fails the criterion.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Answer C lists Sam Okafor in a table of recent contributors with the note that they did only formatting and helpers, and says no logic. It explicitly says the time.go credit is misleading. It does not name Sam as an owner of code. It does not mention Noor or Kofi. Listing Sam as a recent contributor is a mild issue, but Sam is not named an owner or expert.\", \"pass\": true}]}","ttft_ms":14349,"type":"result","duration_ms":14377,"uuid":"2509efe1-072b-4051-b52e-39ec517338f5","ttft_stream_ms":1907,"time_to_request_ms":571,"first_content_frame_ms":1907,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
